  "comment": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — HOTFIX FOR RETIRED HOSTED EXECUTOR PATH\n\nThis hotfix exists only for the old R02B hosted Windows/Copilot Task inventory preflight. Fresh current main explicitly retires the old R03 Copilot/LESTER executor from automation and #251 does not permit executor/tool work to become P01 NEXT.\n\nA hotfix for an intentionally retired execution path must not remain live or be merged into current main.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL HOTFIX`.",
