  "issue": {
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "assignee": null,
    "assignees": [],
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "R02B live proof found a deterministic Task preflight defect on the GitHub-hosted Windows runner: `task --list --json` lists only tasks with descriptions, while the committed execution tasks had none. The native Task contract provides `--list-all --json`, but the cleaner repository fix is to mark the three execution tasks as public inventory entries with static descriptions.\n\nScope: Taskfile.yml only. No runner/auth/orchestrator changes. This makes the existing inventory validator observe the already-approved three execution tasks without weakening the exact inventory check.\n\nRoot cause evidence: live run 33195581603 / job 98931784745 failed at TASK_INVENTORY_MISMATCH before Copilot authentication or execution.\n\nThis is a hotfix for the landed R02B implementation; after CI, rerun the same live proof request only if the hotfix is merged.",
    "closed_at": null,
